{"ref":"BDB, אֵילִים","hw":"אֵילִים","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִים</span>]</big>  always <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵילִם</span> <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong>= place of <em>terebinths</em> or other great trees, v. Di <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:6\" href=\"/Genesis.14.6\">Gn 14:6</a> & <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a> (<a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:12\" href=\"/Exodus.15.12\">12</a> fountains & 70 palms)<strong>)</strong> 2nd station of Isr. in desert after passing sea <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:1\" href=\"/Exodus.16.1\">Ex 16:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:9\" href=\"/Numbers.33.9\">Nu 33:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:10\" href=\"/Numbers.33.10\">10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵי֫לִמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:27\" href=\"/Exodus.15.27\">Ex 15:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:9\" href=\"/Numbers.33.9\">Nu 33:9</a>; prob. = Wady Gharandel cf. Rob<sup>BR i. 100, 105</sup>.","next":"BDB, אֵלָה","prev":"BDB, אֵיל פָּארָן"}